      "source_note": "PMK 101/PMK.010/2016 Pasal 1 (PTKP annual amounts): TK/0 Rp54.000.000; TK/1 = K/0 Rp58.500.000; TK/2 = K/1 Rp63.000.000; TK/3 = K/2 Rp67.500.000; K/3 Rp72.000.000. Feeds the legacy PROGRESSIVE_BRACKET path and the December ANNUAL_PROGRESSIVE true-up (phase P3) — the monthly TER path (PMK 168/2023) needs no PTKP subtraction.",
      "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
