      "source_note": "PP 35/2021 j.o. Kepmenaker 102/2004 (upah lembur): hourly rate = monthly wage (pokok) / 173; weekday overtime 1.5x the first hour then 2x thereafter; rest-day/holiday overtime 2x hours 1-7, 3x hour 8, 4x hours 9-10. NOW LIVE (Track P Phase P7) — the OVERTIME pay_component (below) and PayrollRunWriter's per-employee overtime resolution consume it; the rule row itself is unchanged from ID-2026.1's dormant transcription.",
      "effective_from": "2026-01-01",
